sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Buyer
    participant M as Exit market
    participant P as Lending pool
    participant S as Seller
    B->>M: Buy, paying with collateral
    M->>P: Repay the buyer's debt, as in 5.3
    Note over P: Part of the collateral is freed
    alt Aave
        M->>P: Redeem freed aToken collateral, approved once
    else Morpho
        M->>P: Withdraw it with the buyer's signed grant
        M->>P: Apply the buyer's signed revoke
    end
    P->>S: Collateral worth the discounted price
    Note over B,P: Reverts if health went down or an authorization remains
